## File Structure
<!-- CUSTOMIZE: Describe your project's directory layout -->
- `src/` - Source code
- `tests/` - Test files
- `config/` - Configuration files
- `data/` - Runtime data (not in git)
- `scripts/git-hooks/` - Git hook sources (installed via `scripts/setup-hooks.sh`)

